    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286710/extras/ceddfd90e366c40465104b73af36fd0c.avif?t=1730391278\" width=534 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Softie is a short point and click game about a teddy bear looking for his owner. Explore a cozy, unassuming home, where an adorable plushie meets unexpected challenges. But don\u2019t worry-teddy bears know nothing of fear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time around 30-40 minutes.\u00a0\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2689\u200b Original Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2689 \u200bHand-drawn\u00a0environment inspired by trinkets and toys of\u00a0the early 2000's\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2689 Odd-ball\u00a0characters to interact with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286710/extras/ceddfd90e366c40465104b73af36fd0c.avif?t=1730391278\" width=534 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Softie is a short point and click game about a teddy bear looking for his owner. Explore a cozy, unassuming home, where an adorable plushie meets unexpected challenges. But don\u2019t worry-teddy bears know nothing of fear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time around 30-40 minutes.\u00a0\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2689\u200b Original Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2689 \u200bHand-drawn\u00a0environment inspired by trinkets and toys of\u00a0the early 2000's\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2689 Odd-ball\u00a0characters to interact with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
